{"id":"153281e750377196","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-hopf-parts.md","title":"Hopf 分解的变换与两类部分","display":"df-hopf-parts — Hopf 分解的变换与两类部分","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hopf-parts","aliases":["58-df-hopf-parts"],"display":"df-hopf-parts — Hopf 分解的变换与两类部分","depends_on":["[[58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hopf-parts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hopf-parts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hopf-parts — Hopf 分解的变换与两类部分"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure.md\">58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,T,C,D,W\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,T,C,D,W\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 采用内部定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{-1}=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T\\}\">\\(T^{-1}=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T\\}\\)</span> 为逆关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T[A]=\\{y\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T):\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T)\\}\">\\(T[A]=\\{y\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T):\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{-1}[A]=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T):\\exists y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T)\\}\">\\(T^{-1}[A]=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T):\\exists y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S\\)</span> 使用四参数接口；后三个部分谓词从测度图恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\mu=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\">\\(\\Sigma_\\mu=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\mu=\\bigcup\\Sigma_\\mu\">\\(X_\\mu=\\bigcup\\Sigma_\\mu\\)</span>。同一次调用始终使用该载体及该可测集族。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in X^X\">\\(T\\in X^X\\)</span> 为双射时，整数迭代函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{(n)}\\in X^X\">\\(T^{(n)}\\in X^X\\)</span> 由下式递归确定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{(n)}[W]\">\\(T^{(n)}[W]\\)</span> 为像集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\mathbin\\triangle B=(A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)\">\\(A\\mathbin\\triangle B=(A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=_\\mu B\">\\(A=_\\mu B\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\">\\(A,B\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\)</span> 时缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\">\\(\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>整数迭代递归中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\operatorname{dom}(T)\">\\(X=\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\)</span>；在三个部分谓词内即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\mu\">\\(X_\\mu\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conservative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conservative}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dissipative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dissipative}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Wandering}\">\\(\\mathrm{Wandering}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}invertible\\text{-}nonsingular}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;(T(x)=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(T[A]\\in\\Sigma\\land T^{-1}[A]\\in\\Sigma\n\\land(\\mu(A)=0\\leftrightarrow\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=0)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}invertible\\text{-}nonsingular}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;(T(x)=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(T[A]\\in\\Sigma\\land T^{-1}[A]\\in\\Sigma\n\\land(\\mu(A)=0\\leftrightarrow\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=0)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integer\\text{-}iterate}\\vdash\nT^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\},\\qquad\nT^{(n+1)}\\coloneqq T\\circ T^{(n)}\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\qquad\nT^{(-n)}\\coloneqq(T^{-1})^{(n)}\\quad(n\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integer\\text{-}iterate}\\vdash\nT^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\},\\qquad\nT^{(n+1)}\\coloneqq T\\circ T^{(n)}\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\qquad\nT^{(-n)}\\coloneqq(T^{-1})^{(n)}\\quad(n\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wandering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(m\\ne n\\to\\mu(T^{(m)}[W]\\cap T^{(n)}[W])=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wandering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(m\\ne n\\to\\mu(T^{(m)}[W]\\cap T^{(n)}[W])=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land C\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\n\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[C]\\mathbin\\triangle C)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\;\\bigl(W\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\\to\\mu(W)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land C\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\n\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[C]\\mathbin\\triangle C)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\;\\bigl(W\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\\to\\mu(W)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dissipative\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land D\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\n\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[D]\\mathbin\\triangle D)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\;\\Bigl(W\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\n\\land\\mu\\bigl(D\\mathbin\\triangle\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}T^{(n)}[W]\\bigr)=0\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dissipative\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land D\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\n\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[D]\\mathbin\\triangle D)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\;\\Bigl(W\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\n\\land\\mu\\bigl(D\\mathbin\\triangle\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}T^{(n)}[W]\\bigr)=0\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有等号模零集均有可测性前提。整数迭代与两类部分由集合函数、测度和可数并给出；不再以“标准遍历论构造”代替定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,T,C,D,W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{-1}=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T[A]=\\{y\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T):\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{-1}[A]=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T):\\exists y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in T)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\mu=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\mu=\\bigcup\\Sigma_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in X^X","display":false},{"tex":"T^{(n)}\\in X^X","display":false},{"tex":"T^{(n)}[W]","display":false},{"tex":"A\\mathbin\\triangle B=(A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)","display":false},{"tex":"A=_\\mu B","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\Sigma_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\operatorname{dom}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conservative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dissipative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Wandering}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}invertible\\text{-}nonsingular}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;(T(x)=y)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(T[A]\\in\\Sigma\\land T^{-1}[A]\\in\\Sigma\n\\land(\\mu(A)=0\\leftrightarrow\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=0)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integer\\text{-}iterate}\\vdash\nT^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\},\\qquad\nT^{(n+1)}\\coloneqq T\\circ T^{(n)}\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\qquad\nT^{(-n)}\\coloneqq(T^{-1})^{(n)}\\quad(n\\in\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wandering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\\\\n&\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(m\\ne n\\to\\mu(T^{(m)}[W]\\cap T^{(n)}[W])=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land C\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\n\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[C]\\mathbin\\triangle C)=0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\;\\bigl(W\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\\to\\mu(W)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dissipative\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X_\\mu,\\Sigma_\\mu,\\mu)\\land D\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\n\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[D]\\mathbin\\triangle D)=0\\\\\n&\\land\\exists W\\in\\Sigma_\\mu\\;\\Bigl(W\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Wandering}_S(W,T,\\mu)\n\\land\\mu\\bigl(D\\mathbin\\triangle\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}T^{(n)}[W]\\bigr)=0\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3381,"backlinks":[{"id":"556df02a0470824a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)$、$\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)$、$\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)$ 及整数迭代使用 [[./58-df-hopf-parts.md]]。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-649","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hopf-parts.md|58-df-hopf-parts]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","36d7463d215be751"]}